{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108289","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108289","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710828901:1":{"text":"隊長！皆を連れて来てくださったのですね！","source_cn":"队长！感谢艾雅，您把大家都带出来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8A3EAF4DEBE58FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710828902:1":{"text":"劇場の周りにバリケードを張ったので、魔物も簡単には入ってこられないと思います。","source_cn":"我们在剧场附近设置了路障，魔物一时半会儿攻不上来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x069E854001C3AC80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710828903:1":{"text":"分かりました。急いで負傷者の治療を手配してください。","source_cn":"很好。受伤的民众记得安排治疗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFCAC7260D0EF187","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710828904:1":{"text":"承知しました。ですが、隊長……実は――","source_cn":"请您放心。但是……队长，还有一个紧急情况——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x263FC1AA5D4F893C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710828905:1":{"text":"今しがた救援信号が入りまして……広場の南西と、古聖堂前の橋の上に、逃げ遅れた民衆が取り残されているとのことです。","source_cn":"刚刚收到求救信号，在广场西南侧和圣古堂前的桥上，还有两...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x859336B39076C7BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710828906:1":{"text":"ですが、助けに行きたくても、これ以上守りの兵力を削るわけには……","source_cn":"我们主要的兵力现在都集中在这里维持防线，要是分兵去救的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3EFE5D475F56633","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710828907:1":{"text":"この場の守りを崩してはなりません。兵力を分散したら、ここにいる人々を守れなくなります。","source_cn":"这里的防线不能动。如果分散兵力，这里的民众也会失去保护。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7858E76E125D693D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710828908:1":{"text":"広場と橋にいる人たちは、私が迎えに行きます！","source_cn":"广场南侧和圣古堂前的桥上，那两处的民众，我去带他们回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3543581CFF7FF6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710828909:1":{"text":"ですが、隊長もお疲れでは……","source_cn":"可是队长！您的体力……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22046CB9B01B9760","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710828910:1":{"text":"これは命令です！あなたたちはここを守りなさい。すぐに戻ります！","source_cn":"执行命令，你们守好这里！我去去就回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE69DCE14C1D55C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710828911:1":{"text":"はっ！","s